<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Visitante en el edificio — BioVisitor X</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }
        .wrapper {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 24px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
            padding: 32px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 4px solid #A11A36;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }
        .header p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .alert-banner {
            background: #f0fdf4;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .alert-icon {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            background: #16a34a;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .alert-banner p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #166534;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .alert-banner span {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #4ade80;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 32px 40px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #1a1a2e;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .intro {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .visitor-card {
            background: #f8f9fb;
            border: 1px solid #e8eaed;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .visitor-card h3 {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #A11A36;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .detail-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 7px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .detail-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #666;
            min-width: 130px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .detail-value { color: #1a1a2e; }
        .detail-value.highlight {
            color: #A11A36;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .checkin-time {
            background: #eff6ff;
            border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #1d4ed8;
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .footer {
            background: #f8f9fb;
            border-top: 1px solid #e8eaed;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .footer a { color: #A11A36; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>BioVisitor X</h1>
            <p>Sistema de Gestión de Visitantes</p>
        </div>

        <div class="alert-banner">
            <div class="alert-icon">✓</div>
            <div>
                <p>Visitante en recepción</p>
                <span style="font-size:12px; color:#15803d;">Check-in completado · {{checkedInTime}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p class="greeting">Hola, <strong>{{hostName}}</strong></p>
            <p class="intro">
                Tu visitante acaba de realizar <strong>check-in</strong> en recepción y se encuentra en el edificio esperándote.
            </p>

            <div class="visitor-card">
                <h3>Datos del Visitante</h3>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Nombre</span>
                    <span class="detail-value highlight">{{visitorName}}</span>
                </div>
                {{#if visitorCompany}}
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Empresa</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{visitorCompany}}</span>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
                {{#if visitorDocument}}
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Documento</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{visitorDocument}}</span>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
                {{#if purpose}}
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Motivo de visita</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{purpose}}</span>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            <div class="checkin-time">
                🕐 &nbsp;Hora de ingreso: <strong>{{checkedInTime}}</strong>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Esta notificación fue generada automáticamente por <strong>BioVisitor X</strong>.</p>
            <p>Si no eres el anfitrión de esta visita, puedes ignorar este mensaje.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:8px; color: #bbb;">© {{year}} BioVisitor X · Todos los derechos reservados</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
